Z||000000||grinthock||06-03-2001||09:49 PM||||Just a reminder the hamilton Cruise night is on!  Everyone in Ontario and around who can make it is invited!! Meet sometime between 6-7pm, the earlier the better at HUTCHES.... Location is on Beach Rd in Hamilton.<P>Hutches is located at 280 VAN WAGNERS BEACH RD<P>MapQuest link<BR> <A HREF="http://www.mapquest.com/cgi-bin/share?spz5a2d34iwcxfzx"" TARGET=_blank>http://www.mapquest.com/cgi-bin/share?spz5a2d34iwcxfzx"</A> <P>Everyone PLEASE try to make it, we are trying to set this up as a normal thing every week!||||reg||1
