Z||000003||grinthock||06-05-2001||09:54 PM||||Just an update on the past show.. I would like to thank,...<P>The Hamilton Optimist club for inviting us.<P>Tim - $50 50/50 draw winner!<P>"hot rod" Bob Cumpson - for bringing the 3800SC Hotrod<P>BanditBalz - Brought his 86GT (THE fastest stock fiero in N/A)<P>Lothar - owner of the 88GT Turbo and 88GT Stock for bringing his stock 88 and making all the calls<P>Ken - for bringing his modified 84 T-Top<P>ME - for bringing my 87GT and trying to arrange this event!<P>Rinehart - For showing up to cheer us on!<P>Fun was had by all, it lasted about 2.5 hours, sun was NOT out and it looked like rain so only 50% of the cars showed, next week should be better!  I want to see everyone out AGAIN!  It will be better next week, plus it gives us all a change to get togeather....  <P><BR>Pics of the show will be available on the website when they are developed... BanditBalz's pro photo chickie got some NICE pics...||||reg||1
